      "en": "Reputation is built by consistency, not sudden virality: a small weekly post, a monthly article/template, a talk or workshop each quarter, and a monthly open contribution. Measure: clients who came from content, invitations, engaged followers (not just counts). And keep it sustainable: two hours a week beats one week a year."
